{"name": "羊伙计烤全羊(宝山店)", "brand_group": "羊伙计", "brand_confirmed": true, "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "内蒙古菜", "烤全羊·手把肉"]], "form": "Casual Dining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "ingredients": ["烧烤烤串", "肉禽"], "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "special_tags": ["包间", "可预订"], "price_avg": 100, "price_range": "¥80-150", "price_sources": [{"platform": "抖音", "value": 100, "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7662750547809036526"}, {"platform": "高德", "value": 173, "url": "https://www.amap.com/"}], "district": "宝山区", "address": "泰和西路2723号", "business_area": "共富新村", "lat": 31.353188, "lng": 121.422816, "coord_source": "amap", "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "大众点评/电话预订", "signature_dishes": ["烤全羊", "盐池滩羊", "下马酒仪式", "哈达迎宾", "篝火晚会"], "status": "open", "scores": {"objective": 72, "diner": 70, "taste": 72, "endorsement": 45, "soft_ad_penalty": 8, "platform_credibility": 0.75}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "在宝山就能感受到蒙古的气息，有蒙古人打飞的也要来吃的烤全羊。一进村就有欢迎礼和下马酒仪式，献哈达吉祥如意。几十个蒙古包还有篝火晚会。", "dish": "烤全羊", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7662750547809036526", "date": "2026-07-15"}, {"quote": "进门就是很有蒙古特色的欢迎仪式，接过哈达和祝福。烤全羊来了吃羊前有仪式感满满的开羊仪式。蒙古包篝火晚会人均100吃烤羊宴。", "dish": "烤全羊", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7662997092831402865", "date": "2026-07-16"}, {"quote": "这烤羊都是盐池滩羊肉，巨鲜巨嫩，撒上撒料直接香迷糊。不仅可以免费体验换装，还有开羊仪式，真的倍有面子。", "dish": "盐池滩羊", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7662640679793841866", "date": "2026-07-15"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "高德", "score": 4.6, "review_count": null, "url": "https://www.amap.com/"}, {"platform": "抖音", "score": 4.0, "review_count": 80, "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7662750547809036526"}], "negative_signals": ["宝山位置偏远", "仪式感大于口味", "团建/派对属性重"], "soft_ad_flags": ["下马酒/哈达/篝火全套表演营销", "'蒙古人打飞的来吃'夸张话术", "免费换蒙古服饰拍照引流"], "traffic_signals": ["团建/派对包场为主", "周末蒙古包满"]}, "sources": [{"title": "高德地图-羊伙计烤全羊(宝山首店)", "url": "https://www.amap.com/", "type": "map"}, {"title": "抖音-羊伙计宝山烤全羊", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7662750547809036526", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "抖音-羊伙计盐池滩羊烤全羊", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7662640679793841866", "type": "ugc"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-23", "notes": "补强：地址由'宝山'补为高德确认的泰和西路2723号(共富新村商圈，坐标121.422816,31.353188)。另补第3条堂食证据(盐池滩羊肉)。高德人均173含整羊分摊，抖音人均100为单点参考。"}
{"name": "家在塔啦·烤全羊·蒙古包餐厅(天钥桥路店)", "brand_group": null, "brand_confirmed": false, "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "内蒙古菜", "烤全羊·手把肉"]], "form": "Casual Dining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "ingredients": ["烧烤烤串", "肉禽"], "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "special_tags": ["包间", "可预订"], "price_avg": 127, "price_range": "¥100-180", "price_sources": [{"platform": "携程", "value": 127, "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/5027261.html"}], "district": "徐汇区", "address": "天钥桥路214号哈尼美食广场4层", "business_area": "徐家汇", "lat": 31.191147, "lng": 121.442021, "coord_source": "amap", "phone_raw": "021-64177277", "booking_method": "电话/大众点评", "signature_dishes": ["烤全羊", "可汗烤羊排", "手把肉", "拔丝奶皮", "牛窝骨煨黄豆", "手工烤包子"], "status": "open", "scores": {"objective": 75, "diner": 80, "taste": 78, "endorsement": 60, "soft_ad_penalty": 3, "platform_credibility": 0.85}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "烤羊排是'家在塔啦'的招牌，不用服务员推荐，顾客到店必点，羊肉外焦里嫩，浓香多汁，不仅美味，性价比也极高。每桌客人在这里喝酒后，都会又唱又跳。", "dish": "可汗烤羊排", "source": "中国作家网", "url": "https://vip.chinawriter.com.cn/member/luxianghua123456/viewarchives_731991.html", "date": "2025-04-03"}, {"quote": "手把肉：肉块大块，口感鲜嫩多汁。牛窝骨分量超大，肉质炖得特别软烂，啃着特别满足。烤串香气浓郁，肉质鲜嫩。", "dish": "手把肉/牛窝骨煨黄豆", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667779695219881587", "date": "2026-07-29"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "携程", "score": 4.5, "review_count": 150, "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/5027261.html"}, {"platform": "Trip.com", "score": 4.5, "review_count": null, "url": "https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/jiazaitalajiazaimenggu-11176262/"}], "negative_signals": ["商场4楼位置", "蒙古包在室内不够真实"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["徐家汇商圈客流", "携程4.5分", "中国作家网专题报道"]}, "sources": [{"title": "携程-家在塔啦天钥桥路店(含本店特色美食列表)", "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/5027261-dianping141321121.html", "type": "platform"}, {"title": "中国作家网-在上海遇见内蒙古(烤羊排招牌)", "url": "https://vip.chinawriter.com.cn/member/luxianghua123456/viewar