{"name": "爱上草原内蒙餐厅(老沪闵路店)", "brand_group": null, "brand_confirmed": false, "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "内蒙古菜", "烤全羊·手把肉"]], "form": "Casual Dining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "ingredients": ["肉禽"], "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "special_tags": ["包间"], "price_avg": 130, "price_range": "¥100-180", "price_sources": [{"platform": "携程笔记", "value": 130, "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=238456814"}], "district": "徐汇区", "address": "老沪闵路700号内蒙古商会", "business_area": "上海南站", "lat": null, "lng": null, "coord_source": null, "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "电话/大众点评", "signature_dishes": ["牧民手把肉", "烤羊背", "皇家金殿牛排", "呼市老烧麦", "蒙式锅茶"], "status": "open", "scores": {"objective": 73, "diner": 78, "taste": 78, "endorsement": 55, "soft_ad_penalty": 3, "platform_credibility": 0.8}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "牧民手把肉原汁原味仅搭野韭花酱，尽显草原豪情。皇家金殿牛排来自草原红牛只用水与盐慢炖。", "dish": "牧民手把肉", "source": "携程笔记", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=238456814", "date": "2025-11-19"}, {"quote": "烤羊背、手把肉、皇家牛排、羊雜湯、鉢雞干豆角、豬排燴酸菜、再來熱氣騰騰出鍋的呼市老燒麥～內蒙商會私廚對外營業了，名字就叫'愛上草原'人均300。磚茶和鮮牛奶加食用鹽熬製。", "dish": "烤羊背/呼市老烧麦", "source": "微博/新浪", "url": "https://www.sina.cn/media/3093711771", "date": "2026-09-21"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "携程", "score": 4.2, "review_count": 50, "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=238456814"}], "negative_signals": ["位置偏内蒙古商会内", "门头低调难找"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["内蒙古商会内部", "内蒙老乡聚餐"]}, "sources": [{"title": "携程笔记-内蒙古宴席吃出草原魂", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=238456814", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "微博/新浪-爱上草原内蒙商会私厨(烤羊背/呼市烧麦)", "url": "https://www.sina.cn/media/3093711771", "type": "news"}, {"title": "抖音-上海4家正宗内蒙菜", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7601515334982124480", "type": "ugc"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-23", "notes": "补强：原仅1条堂食证据，现补第2条(微博/新浪)含烤羊背/皇家牛排/羊杂汤/钵鸡干豆角/猪排烩酸菜/呼市老烧麦等具体菜品。sources跨ugc+ne