{"name": "东北四季饺子王(茅台路店)", "brand_group": "东北四季饺子王", "brand_confirmed": false, "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "东北菜", "东北饺子"]], "form": "快餐简餐", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "ingredients": ["面", "肉禽"], "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0}, "special_tags": [], "price_avg": 60, "price_range": "¥50-75", "price_sources": [{"platform": "途牛", "value": 60, "url": "https://m.tuniu.com/restaurant/2021163/"}], "district": "长宁区", "address": "茅台路190号(近古北路)", "business_area": "虹桥", "lat": null, "lng": null, "coord_source": null, "phone_raw": "021-62337577", "booking_method": "到店", "signature_dishes": ["酸菜饺子", "锅包肉", "东北大拉皮", "地三鲜", "酱大骨"], "status": "open", "scores": {"objective": 76, "diner": 74, "taste": 74, "endorsement": 50, "soft_ad_penalty": 3, "platform_credibility": 0.85}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "他家酸菜肉馅饺子味挺正，酸菜不是特别酸那种，里面肉加得不少，调味比较中规中矩。锅包肉一口下去都呛，在东北吃的就这味儿。香酥鸡外焦里嫩多汁。", "dish": "酸菜饺子/锅包肉", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7679769097243987236", "date": "2026-08-30"}, {"quote": "大拉皮拌开又香又解腻，除了量比东北小，可以说是桌桌必点。最惊艳是酸菜饺子，吃出了我妈包的味道。人均30左右就能吃到4人配置。", "dish": "酸菜饺子/大拉皮", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7679769097243987236", "date": "2026-08-30"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "途牛", "score": 4.4, "review_count": 200, "url": "https://m.tuniu.com/restaurant/2021163/"}], "negative_signals": ["分量比东北小", "口味中规中矩非惊艳"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["家常复购", "人均30-60高性价比"]}, "sources": [{"title": "途牛-东北四季饺子王茅台路店(茅台路190号)", "url": "https://m.tuniu.com/restaurant/2021163/", "type": "platform"}, {"title": "抖音-上海热门东北菜东北四季饺子王", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7679769097243987236", "type": "ugc"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-23", "notes": "地址补全：茅台路190号(近古北路)(途牛/本地宝双源确认，电话021-62337577)。verdict: keep。"}
